tkrzw-dict — https://github.com/estraier/tkrzw-dict
================================================================================

  Copyright 2020 Google LLC
  Author: Mikio Hirabayashi

  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  tkrzw-dict is a set of scripts and data that build and search a union
  English-Japanese dictionary on top of the Tkrzw key-value store.

  This project does not redistribute the tkrzw-dict source code.  It depends on
  a checkout of it and applies a patch, patches/tkrzw-dict-use-pytkrzw.patch,
  which redirects the upstream `import tkrzw` statements to this project's
  pure-Python reader.  See README.md, "Relation to upstream".

================================================================================
Tkrzw — https://dbmx.net/tkrzw/
================================================================================

  Copyright 2020 Google LLC
  Author: Mikio Hirabayashi

  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Tkrzw is the key-value store whose HashDBM on-disk format the union
  dictionary uses.  This project does not link against the Tkrzw C++ library or
  its Python extension.  tkrzw_dict_agent/core/pytkrzw.py is an independent,
  read-only implementation of the HashDBM record format, written from the
  documented format and the published Tkrzw sources.

================================================================================
Union dictionary data — https://dbmx.net/dict/
================================================================================

  The dictionary data (union-body.tkh, union-tran-index.tkh,
  union-infl-index.tkh, union-keys.txt, union-tran-keys.txt,
  union-examples.tsv, and the union-dict-data.tar.gz archive) is NOT part of
  this repository.  It is downloaded separately by scripts/setup.sh from
  https://dbmx.net/dict/union-dict-data.tar.gz.

  That data is compiled from open sources, each carrying its own license:

    WordNet                 https://wordnet.princeton.edu/
    Japanese WordNet        https://bond-lab.github.io/wnja/
    Wiktionary (en, ja)     https://en.wiktionary.org/  https://ja.wiktionary.org/
    Wikipedia (en, ja)      https://en.wikipedia.org/  https://ja.wikipedia.org/
    EDict2                  http://www.edrdg.org/jmdict/edict.html
    Tanaka Corpus           http://edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/Tanaka_Corpus
    WikiCorpus              https://alaginrc.nict.go.jp/WikiCorpus/
    Japanese-English Subtitle Corpus
                            https://nlp.stanford.edu/projects/jesc/
    CCAligned               https://www.statmt.org/cc-aligned/
    Open American National Corpus
                            https://anc.org/
    Common Crawl            https://commoncrawl.org/

  Refer to those sites for the license of each data source.  Redistribution of
  the dictionary data is governed by their terms, not by the license of this
  project's source code.

